      "title": "After this PDF you can",
      "bullets": [
        "recognise how a pronominal form (se) changes a verb's meaning",
        "use fixed expressions with dar, echar, tirar, meter, poner, hacer, tomar, sacar",
        "use phrasal-style expressions (dar con, dar por, echar de menos, tener que ver con)",
        "avoid literal translations from English and Dutch"
