      "title": "se = intensifier",
      "text": "Spanish often adds <b>se</b> to show involvement or completion: <i>Se leyó el libro</i> (he read the whole book), <i>Me bebí el café</i> (I drank it all up). Dutch adds <i>helemaal</i> or <i>op</i>; Spanish adds a pronoun."
